<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Lever first-half up 17.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Lever first-half up 17.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales			6,316 vs 5,387</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     239 vs   229</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit	    170 vs   179</p>
<p>    dividend		  30 pct vs 40 pct</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
